-atlas/wisconsin/grant-county"],["ARC or PLC in Grant County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/grant-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 through 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 21% of normal in January to February and 46% in September to October. Grid 27157 had its driest year in 1988 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
